            </note>
            <note corresp="#d660-f2" n="53" xml:id="d660-f2-content">
                <p>For text of memorandum dated November 5, 1934, see <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_140"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >i</hi>, p. 140</ref>. The Ambassador in his telegram No. 246, November
                    7, 10 a.m. (893.6363 Manchuria/67), reported: “The British Embassy has received
                    a similar memorandum.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
